                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.512/608: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-07-21T16:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 21, 1927—4
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>292. Your telegram 748, July 20, 1 p.m. Paragraph 4 of Department’s 283 of July
                    12, 3 p.m. applies to tobacco as well as other taxes and you may instruct
                    Cunningham accordingly.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
